  "voice": {
    "post_text": [
      "Over 100 years ago William Croghan, a hand engraver and jeweler opened his store in an 18th century Charleston single house on King St. Croghan's Jewel Box is a treasure trove of the most exciting and unique inventory of jewelry. From Wedding Services, Estate and Antique finds to gifts for every occasion.",
      "We’re so honored to have been part of such a meaningful chapter in this lovely couple’s story. From a surprise proposal on Folly Beach to celebrating alongside their family and friends, every moment of this day was truly unforgettable. Wishing you both a lifetime filled with love and endless happiness!"
    ],
